  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Supplication**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- **Greatest Story Ever Told**: rare: 12 archived performances [8]\n- **Hey Jude**: rare: 13 archived performances [8]\n- **Old Broadcast**: rare: 7 archived performances [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2025-04-17** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 177 min; rated 2.5/5 by 6 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lineup listed: Weir on rhythm guitar and vocals, Hart on percussion, Mayer on lead guitar, Burbridge on bass [1]\n- Reviewer asks whether there was a big ruckus in the crowd between dancers and people who wanted to sit [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2025-04-17**: taped by Cam Keough; transferred by Cam Keough; source: Sennheiser MKE 2 -> Naiant Tinyhead-> Pixel 5 (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with Sennheiser MKE 2 mics into a Naiant Tinyhead preamp and a Pixel 5 at 24-bit/48kHz; Processed through Adobe Audition, then CD WAVE, then THL (lineage chain as listed by the uploader) [1]",
